OL,3,AFlights grounded across US as homeland
OL,4,Asecurity secretary says no indication
OL,5,Aof an attack
OL,6,
OL,7,FFlights have been grounded across the
OL,8,FUS due to an air traffic control
OL,9,Fcommunications issue - here's what we
OL,10,Fknow so far
OL,12,FThere's no indication that this is an
OL,13,Fattack against the US, the homeland
OL,14,Fsecurity secretary says, adding that
OL,15,F"everybody's safe" - what else did he
OL,16,Fsay?
OL,18,FUS aviation officials earlier issued an
OL,19,Forder to ground all flights due to
OL,20,F"extraordinary circumstances and for
OL,21,Freasons of safety"
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
